# The findings report. It describes unfixed bugs in a plugin whose repository
# is public, so it must never be committed here. It lives in the private
# `asb-deepsec-findings` repository instead, and is regenerated on demand with
# `bin/report-findings.py > FINDINGS.md`.
FINDINGS.md

# Scan output — regenerated by `deepsec scan` / `process`. INFO.md
# and SETUP.md (manually edited) stay tracked.
data/*/files/
data/*/runs/
data/*/reports/
data/*/debug/
data/*/project.json
data/*/tech.json
data/*/setup/
